{'symbol': 'AMGN', 'date': '2022-02-03 09:00:00', 'title': 'AMGEN AND PLEXIUM ANNOUNCE MULTI-YEAR, DRUG DISCOVERY COLLABORATION TO IDENTIFY NOVEL TARGETED PROTEIN DEGRADATION THERAPIES', 'text': 'THOUSAND OAKS, CALIF.\xa0AND\xa0SAN DIEGO, FEB. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMGEN (NASDAQ:AMGN) AND PLEXIUM, INC. (PLEXIUM) TODAY ANNOUNCED AN EXCLUSIVE, WORLDWIDE, MULTI-YEAR RESEARCH COLLABORATION AND LICENSE AGREEMENT TO IDENTIFY NOVEL TARGETED PROTEIN DEGRADATION THERAPEUTICS TOWARD HISTORICALLY CHALLENGING DRUG TARGETS.'}